-- 59 (added after reading the encoding's shapes; expected value from R4/R5):
-- A 1 Jun, B 30 Jul 2027; days within the period 2 Jun-15 Jul = 44 -> 28 Aug,
-- inside the window 1 Jun-30 Aug -> 30 Aug 2027.
#ASSERT withEC `a defective or reduced offer (27BG(2)-(4))` (Date 15 1 2027) (Date 1 6 2027) (Date 30 7 2027) EQUALS Date 30 8 2027

-- Top-level goal (scenario 60: the goal composes the three answers)
GIVEN nn IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Worker case`
mkCase nn MEANS `Worker case` OF JUST (mkNwe nn), JUST (mkDis (Date 1 1 2027) (Date 30 6 2027) FALSE FALSE), JUST (`Complaint facts` OF `no guaranteed hours offer (27BG(1))`, Date 15 1 2027, NOTHING)

pos MEANS `the worker position for` (mkCase 100)
#ASSERT pos's `weekly statutory sick pay` EQUALS JUST 80
#ASSERT pos's `first day statutory sick pay is payable` EQUALS JUST (Date 4 1 2027)
#ASSERT pos's `meets the unfair dismissal qualifying period` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT pos's `last day to present the guaranteed-hours complaint` EQUALS JUST (Date 15 7 2027)
